Vita Moonlight mbedTLS compatibility patch
Copyright (C) 2026 Vita Moonlight contributors
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

This patch adds the small platform adaptations needed to build the official
Mbed TLS 3.6.7 source with VitaSDK. Apply it with `git apply`; fuzzy matching
is intentionally not supported.

